WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
My name is Jouler Talaigua,

2
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:04.500
I'm 22 years old,
I'm a graduate of SENA.

3
00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:07.300
If there's one thing I've learned
over the course of my career,

4
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.400
it's that what has helped me grow
technically and as a person...

5
00:00:11.550 --> 00:00:14.560
is the quality of the people
I interact with at Pragma.

6
00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.140
On every project
I was part of,

7
00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:18.400
there was always someone
who taught me something,

8
00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:21.500
both on a technical level
and on a personal level.

9
00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.780
So that helps me
develop my skills,

10
00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:27.780
both technical and soft skills,
or my skills as a person,

11
00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:31.800
and they will help me reach my goal
as a solutions architect.
